Minato's patch to frameworks/base's media/java/android/media/MediaCodecList.java at android-15.0.0_r1 (Apache-2.0),
ADR-0060 e2b3: the static initializer loads no libmedia_jni.

Why: as MediaCodec's (mediacodec-without-media-jni.patch): its natives are libandroid_runtime's
(framework/native/android_runtime/android_media_MediaCodecList.cpp), registered when the process starts.

--- a/media/java/android/media/MediaCodecList.java
+++ b/media/java/android/media/MediaCodecList.java
@@ -186,7 +186,7 @@
     }
 
     static {
-        System.loadLibrary("media_jni");
+        // Minato: the natives are libandroid_runtime's (android_media_MediaCodecList.cpp), registered at the start.
         native_init();
 
         // mediaserver is not yet alive here
